    <description>A 1.10 x 1.40 m curtained window decal for hanging ABOVE a 0.900 m counter (bottom at counter height, top at 2.300 under a 2.5 m ceiling). Same texture as window_curtains, whose 2.0 m height would run through the counter; 1.10/1.40 preserves that texture's 0.784 aspect.</description>
</model>
